repository-code: "https://github.com/brenthoagland/organizational-consolidation-toolkit"
abstract: >-
  R toolkit implementing the concept-methods package for measuring
  organizational consolidation: association rule mining, latent class analysis,
  zero-inflated Poisson regression, and partial-order status-hierarchy modeling.
